  [38;5;246mRunner, test/ layout, fake-clock helper, one passing fixture. Core of approach A.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m [ ] End-to-end tests
  [38;5;246mPlaywright against the static server. Catches the DOM layer that unit tests deliberately skip. Meaningful setup cost.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m [ ] Neither lint nor e2e
  [38;5;246mUnit tests only. Leanest prototype; both are addable later at some cost.[39m
